              "text": "Husky Winter Sports believes the mountain should be for everyone. Help us keep the slopes alive! Our dedicated instructors volunteer their time to teach skiing and snowboarding to enthusiasts of all ages. With your donation, we can provide them with the resources they need to continue sharing their passion for the sport."
